  "description": "Reads plain text into a DocWright Word document and extracts a Word document's text, with no third-party dependencies. Reading has deterministic encoding detection and a choice of paragraph modes (line per paragraph, blank-line separated, reflow); writing renders tables as tabs, aligned columns or paragraphs, with options for breaks, headers, footers, notes, line endings and encoding. Plain text is never auto-detected: ask for it explicitly. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
